上一台，不仅仅是礼物，更是一份切实的惦念。\n需要购买的听友们有以下三种方式可以获得专属购买福利：\n\n1、点击进入专属购买链接：\n淘宝：https://mo.m.tmall.com/page/38223779?shop_id=227373533&item_id=979586606917\n京东：https://pro.m.jd.com/mall/active/6g3oUJKAGvkecWzj651t4G8xGGi/index.html\n\n2、复制淘口令：88￥2IfdTuN4I8q￥ / HU108\n\n3、在淘宝搜索：“妙界〞 找到【妙界旗舰店】向客服报暗号“落日之后”即可获得专属链接\n\n【其他】\n主播：@Gold_金龙鱼 @根号乙\n参考资料：\nForensic Files, S2E6 “The Blood Trail”（1997）\n\nEugene Byrne, “The car bomb and shotgun murder mystery that rocked a sleepy hamlet”, Gloucestershire Live, 4 May 2024\n\nThe Times, 19 February 1985 — “Farmer jailed for life”\n\nThe Guardian, 6 February 1985 — “Farmer says he shot neighbour after being attacked with a knife”\n\nThe National Archives — DPP 2/8704: Graham Winston Backhouse\n\nColin Wilson, Clues! A History of Forensic Detection（1989），pp. 224–227\n\nMurderpedia「Graham Backhouse」\n\n在小宇宙查看该单集文稿","bild_url":"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5NqGXYp-HSzxxtFjj41jIqvqkl.png","kapitel_quelle":"modell"}